class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.666ho2xm4dum" class="t7"><u>SheenBidi</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-3"><p class="p8"><a href="#heading-h.kcnb24fxnlry" class="t7"><u>Printing</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.d4pw60ks73ox" class="t7"><u>Cairo</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.yhw2pzcbbb7v" class="t7"><u>Skia</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.kc4bdfcaz5dk" class="t7"><u>Qt</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-3"><p class="p8"><a href="#heading-h.hdjlgp8q66fd" class="t7"><u>Font configuration &amp; selection</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.48bqqqv4skcw" class="t7"><u>Fontconfig</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-3"><p class="p8"><a href="#heading-h.6wcypkmb1qul" class="t7"><u>Layout engines</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.i1cjneozux39" class="t7"><u>Minikin</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.ac88122fep86" class="t7"><u>Pango</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.i1703216tynp" class="t7"><u>Raqm</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.kwgahjv2bow" class="t7"><u>Skia Text</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.nfkr87smtlfq" class="t7"><u>QTextLayout</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-3"><p class="p8"><a href="#heading-h.h7238b86y13d" class="t7"><u>GUI toolkits</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.kp80wgi5raq7" class="t7"><u>GTK</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.k6635e4q3evg" class="t7"><u>Qt</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.e2ry7l6nj844" class="t7"><u>Flutter</u></a></p></div> <div class="toc-level-4"><p class="p9"><a href="#heading-h.seuwf895y8y" class="t7